@startuml classes-importacao
!include ../../../../docs/diagramas/tema-catalogo.iuml
title $I_CSV Pacote imports: leitura de CSV, validação da planilha e processamento em segundo plano

hide empty members
hide <<entrada>> stereotype
hide <<serviço>> stereotype
hide <<infra>> stereotype
hide <<exceção>> stereotype
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 45

class "<$robot,scale=0.55,color=#EF6C00> ProductImportWorker" as ProductImportWorker <<@ApplicationScoped>> <<entrada>> {
  -imports : ProductImportService
  -lifecycle : Lifecycle
  -config : CatalogConfig
  -lines : Map<ImportOutcome, Counter>
  --
  <<@Scheduled product-import, SKIP>> run() : Uni<Void>
  -process(claimed) : Uni<Void>
  -count(claimed, results)
}
class "<$file_csv,scale=0.55,color=#455A64> ProductCsv" as ProductCsv <<final>> {
  {static} COLUMNS : List<String>
  --
  {static} validate(body, maxRows) : Validated
  {static} rows(content) : List<ImportRow>
}
class "ProductCsv.Validated" as Validated <<record>> {
  content : String
  totalLines : int
}
class "ProductCsv.Fields" as Fields <<privada>> {
  -values : List<String>
  -errors : List<String>
  -failed : Set<String>
}
class CsvParser <<final>> {
  -text : String
  --
  {static} parse(text) : List<Record>
}
class "CsvParser.Record" as CsvRecord <<record>> {
  line : int
  fields : List<String>
}
class "CsvParser.SyntaxException" as SyntaxException <<final>> <<exceção>> {
  -line : int
  --
  line() : int
}
class InvalidImportFileException <<exceção>> {
  -reasons : List<String>
  --
  InvalidImportFileException(message, reasons)
  reasons() : List<String>
}
class Offload <<final>> {
  {static} cpu(work) : Uni<T>
}

class RuntimeException <<infra>> #line.dashed
class "application.ImportRow" as ImportRow <<record>> <<serviço>> #line.dashed
class "application.ImportResult" as ImportResult <<record>> <<serviço>> #line.dashed
class "application.ProductImportService" as ProductImportService <<serviço>> #line.dashed
class "application.ProductImportRepository.Claimed" as Claimed <<record>> <<serviço>> #line.dashed
class "api.ProductImportResource" as ProductImportResource <<entrada>> #line.dashed
class "api.ProblemMappers" as ProblemMappers <<entrada>> #line.dashed
class "observability.Lifecycle" as Lifecycle <<infra>> #line.dashed
interface "observability.Refusal" as Refusal <<infra>> #line.dashed

RuntimeException <|-- InvalidImportFileException
Refusal <|.. InvalidImportFileException
RuntimeException <|-- SyntaxException

ProductImportWorker --> ProductImportService : claimNext(lease), process(job, rows)
ProductImportWorker ..> ProductCsv : rows(content)
ProductImportWorker ..> Offload : cpu
ProductImportWorker ..> Claimed
ProductImportWorker ..> ImportResult : conta por resultado
ProductImportWorker ..> Lifecycle : job, step, nested

ProductCsv ..> CsvParser : parse
ProductCsv ..> ImportRow : converte cada registro
ProductCsv ..> InvalidImportFileException : arquivo recusado
ProductCsv +-- Validated
ProductCsv +-- Fields
CsvParser +-- CsvRecord
CsvParser +-- SyntaxException
CsvParser ..> SyntaxException : lança

ProductImportResource ..> ProductCsv : validate(body, maxRows)
ProductImportResource ..> Offload : cpu
ProblemMappers ..> InvalidImportFileException : 400 invalid-import-file
Lifecycle ..> Refusal : classifica como recusa

note bottom of ProductCsv
  CSV RFC 4180 em UTF-8 (BOM opcional) com o cabeçalho COLUMNS, exato e nesta ordem.
  Valida codificação, sintaxe, cabeçalho e quantidade de linhas e converte cada registro
  de dados em ImportRow; o arquivo recusado leva os motivos estáveis em reasons.
end note

note bottom of ProductImportWorker
  Um lote por execução. Vários pods trabalham juntos sem repetir lote porque a
  reivindicação usa FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED; lote interrompido é retomado depois do
  lease, a partir das linhas ainda sem resultado. A conversão do CSV roda no pool de CPU
  (Offload), fora do event loop.
end note

legend right
  <b>Leitura</b>
  <back:$BORDA_ENTRADA>    </back> Entrada: agendador, resource e mapeador de erros
  <back:#90A4AE>    </back> Leitura e validação do CSV
  <back:$BORDA_ERRO>    </back> Recusa do arquivo ou erro de sintaxe
  <back:$BORDA_APLICACAO>    </back> Aplicação / <back:$BORDA_INFRA>    </back> Infraestrutura
  Borda tracejada: classe de outro pacote
endlegend
@enduml
